    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="fdb12d61-8fbf-5d22-83d9-8ec748c9fb0f" activityNameId="42d2b361-1b20-5841-a5fd-e10fa2fc39a6" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Zinc sulphide, ZnS, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Zinc sulphide, ZnS, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of solid zinc sulfide powder. Large uncertainty of the process data due to weak data on the production process and missing data on process emissions.;
CAS number: 001314-98-3; 
Formula: ZnS; 
UUID: 49d678f2-4612-36db-8f26-4a37692d5ca3
Raw materials and chemicals used for production, transport of materials to manufacturing plant, estimated emissions to air and water from production (incomplete), estimation of energy demand and infrastructure of the plant (approximation). Solid wastes omitted.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Production zinc monosulphate and hydrogen sulfide, assuming a yield of 95%. Raw material inputs are calculated according to stoichiometry. The emissions to air and water were estimated using mass balance.
Time period: data of published literature
Production volume: na
Sampling: Process data based on stoichiometry. Energy demand based on approximation from large chemical plant. Process emissions based on estimations only. 
Extrapolations: see generalComment
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_49d678f2-4612-36db-8f26-4a37692d5ca3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
